<title>USA: Entremed cites good thalidomide results.</title>
<headline>Entremed cites good thalidomide results.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKVILLE, Md. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>EntreMed Inc on Wednesday reported successful interim results in Phase II clinical trials of patients with brain cancer and Kaposi's sarcoma being treated with thalidomide.</p>
<p>The company said data showed a 50-percent biological response among 32 patients with progressive brain cancer following at least two months of treatment with thalidomide.</p>
